        "description": "Pragmata has a ton of collectibles in every zone, but the good news is, you don't technically have to find everything to get that 100% score on your map. You don't need every file and hologram, but you will need to find every Safe Box, Read Earth Memory, and upgrade. This guide will help you do that in the game's second sector, the Mass Production Array. Cabin Buddies don't count toward the 100% score, but we're throwing them in too, as a treat.\n\n0:00 - Intro\n0:30 - Test Site Entrance - Safe Box #1\n0:53 - Test Site Entrance - Safe Box #2\n1:03 - Test Site Entrance - Safe Box #3\n1:18 - Shopping District - Pure Lunum #1\n1:48 - Shopping District - Mod #1\n2:07 - Shopping District - Mini Cabin Buddy\u00a0\n2:17 - Shopping District - Safe Box #1\n2:28 - Shopping District - Safe Box #2\n2:43 - Shopping District - Pure Lunum #2 & Safe Box #3\n2:56 - Shopping District - Safe Box #4\n3:14 - Shopping District - Safe Box #5\n3:31 - Shopping District - Read Earth Memory\n3:42 - Shopping District - Mod #2\n3:49 ",
